":"秋 史恭","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20185","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"miho","creatorId":"vndb:s7269","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7269","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7269","name":"miho","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20194","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"おとぎ 遊戯","creatorId":"vndb:s7537","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7537","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7537","name":"おとぎ 遊戯","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:20196","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c44889","characterName":"ミレイユ・アルティス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"124661","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165371"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19665"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44889"},"originalCharacterName":"ミレイユ・アルティス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Affiliation: Cranvar."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A poor girl from Haidopair who she took up a job as a mercenary. Mireille lost her parents in the war when she was little, and at that time she happened to meet Felix, the Count. Through some twists and turns, her life changes for the better as she gains friendships that transcend her status."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44889"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無尽の友情を誓った守るべき者のため、戦場を疾走する傭兵"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を戦争で亡くした、ハイドパイル出身の傭兵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伯爵家の御曹司だった主人公と、偶然知り合った彼女は、紆余曲折を経て、身分を超えた友情を育んでいく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自らの力で友を守りたいとの願いが、彼女に傭兵の道を選ばせた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あたしはあの時、心に誓ったから……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19665","sourceWorkId":"9584","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハイドパイル出身。もとは貧民で、現在は傭兵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少女時代、両親を戦争で亡くしており、その頃に伯爵家御曹司フェリクスと偶然知りあう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紆余曲折を経て、身分を超えた友誼を得たことで、ミレイユの人生は変わっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自らの力で友を守ることのできる人間に――その願いがミレイユに傭兵への道を選ばせた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あたしはあの時、心に誓ったから……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"124661"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79ab0050e6c8891f512b2ca2e980903f32b39dd16c26154c0475c3d311e51f17.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a919af11ed40c5bfe96f62e1bb063693c8aea58f0372dba46fb815e63b585e2a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:165371:124661:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44890","characterName":"ウルリカ・エク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"124662","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165371"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19666"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44890"},"originalCharacterName":"ウルリカ・エク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Affiliation: Edingard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A magic blacksmith with golden eyes, the third daughter of merchant in Edingard. When Ulrika had her baptism at the Holy Church, she was told she had \"Geist's Eyes\". Since then her childhood was ended up taken from her and she had not seen one peaceful day. Once she gaot a little bit older, Ulrika became a member of Orva Geist, a leading group blacksmith in her continent, where her powers comes in handy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44890"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"金の瞳に生まれた意味を鋼にこめて敵を討つ、魔導の鍛冶師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“ガイストの眼”を持つ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その類稀なる能力を鍛冶師集団「オルヴァ・ガイスト」に見出された彼女は、俗世に別れを告げ、その瞳で自らの“生まれた意味”を見つめ続ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちっちゃい言うな……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19666","sourceWorkId":"9584","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エディンガルドの商家に三女として生まれ、聖教会の洗礼の時に、『ガイストの眼』を持っていると告げられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その瞳ゆえに平穏な日々を送ることができず、幼い心に傷も負った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、その類稀なる能力を、大陸有数の鍛冶師集団『オルヴァ・ガイスト』に見いだされ、俗世に別れを告げた少女は、その瞳で自分の生まれた意味を見つめ続けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちっちゃい言うな…」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"124662"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cc754b3e78aabaac9f21a2adc60d7e957f3b17952b9b567429996e5e6b9eaae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79828f1b53379eefab2a953a7e066ad39f957af8e6ef876d1b76cec43ec75ce2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:165371:124662:4810:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44892","characterName":"マリー・ジュノーン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"124660","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165371"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19664"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44892"},"originalCharacterName":"マリー・ジュノーン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Princess of Cranvar who studied magic abroad in Edingard. Marie is graceful, but curious. She often travels around her kingdom, leaving behind her royal capital. Her behavior greatly annoys her father, King Henry."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44892"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"救世の英雄を求め、淡い恋の中にそれを見出していく王女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心旺盛なクランヴァールの王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的にはお淑やかな女性だが、一度“これ”と決めたことには、自分の全てを賭けて取り組む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国領を巡り王都を空けることが多く、父である王を悩ませている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……いつまでも貴方のそばにいます」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19664","sourceWorkId":"9584","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クランヴァールの王女。基本的にはお淑やかだが、好奇心旺盛で深窓に収まっていら"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"れる性格ではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国領を巡り、王都を空けていることも多く、父であるアンリ王を悩ませている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひとたび「これ」と決めたことには自分にできるすべてを賭けて取り組む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エディンガルドに留学していた過去もあり、魔導の知識がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…いつでも貴方のそばにいます」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"124660"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79715f4990b1426c453dc9befbd385bbbf40483f4bcf458537e86a586a06304f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f189c61b444ef138d8b1db35fdb0ca4b93e62c9b5d2a07254add3b8b53ddfad5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"平山 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:165371:124660:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44894","characterName":"アリア・フォルトゥナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"124659","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165371"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19663"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44894"},"originalCharacterName":"アリア・フォルトゥナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Affiliation: Edingard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who was summoned from another world (modern Japan) to become the princess shrine maiden of Edingard. Aria's house runs a Catholic church, and her father is a priest. She has a gentle personality, she treats any person indiscriminately, but she is sometimes bothered by a natural de-focusing behavior which makes her sick. She follows Felix, who helps her out in this strange world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44894"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神に抗い羽ばたくための翼を求め、心彷徨わせる異邦の少女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エディンガルドの姫巫女として、異世界から召喚された少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかな性格で、どんな相手にも分け隔てることなく接するが、時に天然ボケの言動で、周囲を呆れさせることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界で助けてくれた主人公に、ついていくことになるが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このままじゃ……、わたしがわたしでなくなっちゃう……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19663","sourceWorkId":"9584","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エディンガルドの姫巫女として、異世界（現代の日本）から召喚されてしまう少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家はカトリックの教会を営んでいて、父が神父をしている。どんな相手にも分け隔てなく"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"接することができる穏やかな性格の持ち主だが、時に天然ボケの言動で周囲を呆れさ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"せることも…。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寄る辺なき異世界で自分を助けてくれたフェリクスについていくことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「このままじゃ、わたしがわたしでなくなっちゃう……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"124659"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09d30d4a7987375bffad10798a9e6ca26fabd40420703bfa1dd35d06ee30c3ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3f6bb4ecfe874d7aec00d2db31442f2c2c240a0814ec0e8fe533cfb8e76fb45.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canon